  "name": "Reaper Spectral Warden and Spectral Scythe hit with their owner's level of weapon damage (#7697)",
  "contract": [
    "Spectral Warden 100481 (spell 805716) and Spectral Scythe 250305 (spell 500484) are guardians with a",
    "pinned 1/1 creature_template level band. Creature::SelectLevel writes level-1 creature_classlevelstats",
    "weapon damage when the summon is created and Guardian::InitStatsForLevel raises only the level, so a",
    "level-43 Reaper's guardians kept their level-1 white hit of 3 damage.",
    "reaper_spectral_guardian_stats re-derives base weapon damage and attack power from creature_classlevelstats",
    "at the guardian's level in OnPlayerAfterGuardianInitStatsForLevel, as ranger_wingman_companions does.",
    "owned_creature_weapon_damage_min reports the lowest value across all copies. Expected: a level-60 Reaper's",
    "guardians report level-60 minimum weapon damage, more than twice a level-20 Reaper's guardians."
  ],
